name: living-section
description: Makes you keep a named status section in a project file true as you work, updating it in the same step as each change. Use when the user wants a progress log, a status section, or notes that stay current during long work.
compatibility: Works in any harness that reads skills and can edit files. These are instructions to the model, not technical limits.
metadata:
  version: "1.0.0"
  aiculator.kind: maintenance
template:
  vars:
    file: PROGRESS.md
