# Living section

<DynamicSection id="status" title="Status" file="{{ file }}" keep="what is done, what is in progress, what is blocked, and the next step" />

## Example

```markdown
<!-- dynamic:status:start -->
Done: login and session handling.
In progress: password reset, with the tests still failing.
Blocked: nothing.
Next: fix the reset token expiry.
<!-- dynamic:status:end -->
```
